{"id":26729,"author":"KeewiDood","body":"Recently Crazy made a forum game with the purpose of naming a place, and then the next person to reply would say another place that starts with the last letter of the previous place. I took some inspiration from Crazy and made another game, but without talking about places this one is gonna be with different food of sorts. If I say a food, the last letter in that food, and then that happens.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOn the last forum game that crazy made he said that you couldn't have one\u0026nbsp;page starting with only A's in this game you can't have a page with food sorts that starts with the same letter.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis is how it's kind of gonna work:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMe:\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003ePotato\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003eSomeone else:\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003eOnion\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003eAnd that's how it goes, like a repetitive game.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003eI'll start:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003ePancakes\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eGood Luck!\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e","body_tagged":"Recently Crazy made a forum game with the purpose of naming a place, and then the next person to reply would say another place that starts with the last letter of the previous place. I took some inspiration from Crazy and made another game, but without talking about places this one is gonna be with different food of sorts. If I say a food, the last letter in that food, and then that happens.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOn the last forum game that crazy made he said that you couldn't have one\u0026nbsp;page starting with only A's in this game you can't have a page with food sorts that starts with the same letter.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\